      en: ["Uppsala University was officially founded in the year 1477.", "Uppsala Cathedral is 118.7 meters tall, making it the tallest in the Nordics.", "The three royal mounds in Gamla Uppsala date back to the 6th century.", "The Linnaean Garden was first established in 1655.", "Uppsala Castle was commissioned by King Gustav Vasa in 1549.", "The city's municipality has a population of approximately 240,000 people."],
