      en: ["Västerås was officially founded in the late 10th century.", "The Anundshög burial mound is 64 meters wide and 9 meters high.", "The company ASEA (now ABB) was founded here in 1883.", "Västerås Cathedral originally dates back to the 13th century.", "The first Swedish national assembly (Riksdag) was held here in 1527.", "The Port of Västerås is the largest inland port in Scandinavia."],
